const copy={fa:{empty:'هنوز نظری منتشر نشده؛ شما شروع‌کنندهٔ گفت‌وگو باشید.',count:'نظر منتشرشده',reply:'پاسخ پرشیا مارکت',pending:'در انتظار بررسی',rejected:'منتشر نشده',saved:'نظر شما ثبت شد و پس از بررسی منتشر می‌شود.',login:'برای ارسال نظر وارد حساب خود شوید.',failed:'ثبت یا دریافت نظر انجام نشد. دوباره تلاش کنید.',rateLimit:'کمی صبر کنید و دوباره تلاش کنید.',invalidData:'متن نظر باید بین ۵ و ۳۰۰۰ نویسه باشد.',mine:'نظرهای اخیر شما',author:'ارسال با نام',more:'نظرهای بیشتر',send:'ارسال نظر',sending:'در حال ارسال…',heading:'نظرها و تجربه‌های شما',intro:'تجربه، پرسش یا پیشنهادتان را بنویسید. نظرها پس از بررسی منتشر می‌شوند.',label:'متن نظر',rating:'امتیاز اختیاری',none:'بدون امتیاز',signIn:'ورود یا ثبت‌نام برای نوشتن نظر'},en:{empty:'No published comments yet. Start the conversation.',count:'published comments',reply:'Persia Market reply',pending:'Awaiting moderation',rejected:'Not published',saved:'Your comment was received and will appear after moderation.',login:'Sign in to submit a comment.',failed:'We could not save or load comments. Please retry.',rateLimit:'Please wait a little before trying again.',invalidData:'Write between 5 and 3,000 characters.',mine:'Your recent comments',author:'Posting as',more:'More comments',send:'Submit comment',sending:'Submitting…',heading:'Your reviews and experiences',intro:'Share an experience, question or suggestion. Comments appear after moderation.',label:'Your comment',rating:'Optional rating',none:'No rating',signIn:'Sign in or register to comment'},it:{empty:'Non ci sono ancora commenti pubblicati. Inizia la conversazione.',count:'commenti pubblicati',reply:'Risposta di Persia Market',pending:'In attesa di moderazione',rejected:'Non pubblicato',saved:'Commento ricevuto: verrà pubblicato dopo la moderazione.',login:'Accedi per inviare un commento.',failed:'Impossibile salvare o caricare i commenti. Riprova.',rateLimit:'Attendi un momento prima di riprovare.',invalidData:'Scrivi tra 5 e 3.000 caratteri.',mine:'I tuoi commenti recenti',author:'Pubblicato come',more:'Altri commenti',send:'Invia commento',sending:'Invio…',heading:'Recensioni ed esperienze',intro:'Condividi un’esperienza, una domanda o un suggerimento. I commenti vengono pubblicati dopo la moderazione.',label:'Il tuo commento',rating:'Voto facoltativo',none:'Senza voto',signIn:'Accedi o registrati per commentare'}};
const esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const date=(s,lang)=>new Intl.DateTimeFormat(lang==='fa'?'fa-IR':lang==='it'?'it-IT':'en-GB',{dateStyle:'medium',timeZone:'Europe/Rome'}).format(new Date(s));
const card=(item,lang)=>{const c=copy[lang];return '<article class="comment-card"><header><strong>'+esc(item.author)+'</strong><time datetime="'+esc(item.createdAt)+'">'+esc(date(item.createdAt,lang))+'</time></header>'+(item.rating?'<p class="comment-rating" aria-label="'+esc(c.rating)+' '+item.rating+' / 5">'+('★'.repeat(item.rating))+'<span>'+('☆'.repeat(5-item.rating))+'</span></p>':'')+'<p class="comment-text" dir="auto">'+esc(item.body)+'</p>'+(item.reply?'<aside class="comment-reply"><strong>'+esc(c.reply)+'</strong><p dir="auto">'+esc(item.reply)+'</p></aside>':'')+'</article>';};
async function request(path,options={}){const res=await fetch(path,{credentials:'same-origin',signal:AbortSignal.timeout(15000),...options});const data=await res.json();if(!res.ok)throw Object.assign(new Error(data.error),{code:data.error});return data;}
export function mountComments(panel){
 if(!panel||panel.dataset.commentsMounted)return;panel.dataset.commentsMounted='true';
 const {commentsKind:kind,commentsTarget:target,commentsLang:lang='it'}=panel.dataset,c=copy[lang],q=s=>panel.querySelector(s),form=q('[data-comment-form]'),status=q('[data-comment-status]');let page=1,user=null,busy=false,requestId=null,draftKey='';
 const message=error=>{status.textContent=c[error.code]||(['sessionExpired','accountChanged'].includes(error.code)?c.login:c.failed);};
 async function load(reset=true){const next=reset?1:page+1;try{const data=await request('/api/comments?'+new URLSearchParams({kind,target,page:String(next)}));if(!panel.isConnected)return;page=next;if(reset)q('[data-comment-list]').innerHTML='';q('[data-comment-list]').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',data.items.map(item=>card(item,lang)).join(''));q('[data-comment-count]').textContent=new Intl.NumberFormat(lang==='fa'?'fa-IR':lang).format(data.total)+' '+c.count;q('[data-comment-empty]').hidden=data.total>0;q('[data-comment-more]').hidden=page>=data.pages;q('[data-comment-mine]').innerHTML=data.mine.length?'<h3>'+esc(c.mine)+'</h3>'+data.mine.map(item=>'<p class="comment-pending">'+esc(c[item.status])+'</p>'+card(item,lang)).join(''):'';}catch(error){if(panel.isConnected)message(error);}}
 async function session(){try{const data=await request('/api/auth/session');if(!panel.isConnected)return;user=data.user;form.hidden=!user;q('[data-comment-login]').hidden=!!user;q('[data-comment-author]').textContent=user?c.author+' '+user.name:'';await load();}catch(error){message(error);}}
 q('[data-comment-more]').addEventListener('click',async event=>{event.target.disabled=true;await load(false);event.target.disabled=false;});
 form.addEventListener('submit',async event=>{event.preventDefault();if(busy||!form.reportValidity())return;if(!user){status.textContent=c.login;return;}const text=form.elements.body.value.trim(),rating=form.elements.rating?.value?Number(form.elements.rating.value):null;if(text.length<5){status.textContent=c.invalidData;return;}const nextKey=JSON.stringify([text,rating,user.id]);if(nextKey!==draftKey){requestId=crypto.randomUUID();draftKey=nextKey;}busy=true;const button=form.querySelector('[type=submit]');button.disabled=true;button.textContent=c.sending;status.textContent='';try{await request('/api/comments',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','X-Persia-User':user.id},body:JSON.stringify({kind,target,body:text,rating,language:lang,requestId})});if(!panel.isConnected)return;form.reset();requestId=null;draftKey='';status.textContent=c.saved;await load();}catch(error){message(error);if(['sessionExpired','accountChanged'].includes(error.code)){user=null;form.hidden=true;q('[data-comment-login]').hidden=false;}}finally{busy=false;button.disabled=false;button.textContent=c.send;}});
 const onChange=()=>{if(!panel.isConnected){window.removeEventListener('storage',onStorage);document.removeEventListener('persia:auth',onChange);return;}session();};
 const onStorage=e=>{if(e.key==='persia.auth.change')onChange();};window.addEventListener('storage',onStorage);document.addEventListener('persia:auth',onChange);session();
}
export function productCommentsMarkup(target,lang){const c=copy[lang];return '<section class="comments-panel" data-comments-kind="product" data-comments-target="'+esc(target)+'" data-comments-lang="'+lang+'"><div class="comments-heading"><p class="comments-kicker">PERSIA COMMUNITY</p><h2>'+esc(c.heading)+'</h2><p>'+esc(c.intro)+'</p></div><p data-comment-count></p><div data-comment-list></div><p data-comment-empty>'+esc(c.empty)+'</p><button type="button" class="comment-button secondary" data-comment-more hidden>'+esc(c.more)+'</button><div data-comment-mine></div><a class="comment-login" data-comment-login href="/account?lang='+lang+'#account/overview">'+esc(c.signIn)+' ↗</a><form data-comment-form hidden><label>'+esc(c.rating)+'<select name="rating"><option value="">'+esc(c.none)+'</option>'+[5,4,3,2,1].map(n=>'<option value="'+n+'">'+n+' / 5</option>').join('')+'</select></label><label>'+esc(c.label)+'<textarea name="body" required minlength="5" maxlength="3000" rows="4"></textarea></label><div class="comment-form-bottom"><small data-comment-author></small><button type="submit" class="comment-button">'+esc(c.send)+'</button></div></form><p role="status" aria-live="polite" data-comment-status></p></section>';}
document.querySelectorAll('[data-comments-kind]').forEach(mountComments);
